INSERT INTO `command` (`name`, `security`, `help`) VALUES
    ('buddy area show', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy area show\n\nNames the roaming part you stand in (its named area, how many parts the area was cut into, its levels and leading monsters) and draws its border in wisps for 30 seconds, along the edges it shares with other parts within 250 yards.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_show.cpp)'),
    ('buddy area spawns', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy area spawns <creature id or name>\n\nPuts a wisp for 30 seconds on every spawn point of that creature (every creature of that name) within 300 yards of you.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_show.cpp)'),
    ('buddy army', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy army [count|dismiss]\n\nOn a test realm only (a realm branch, which sets Buddies.TestRealm): raises an army round you of 64 (or the count, 1 to 200), your own buddies in the world first and random stand-ins of your side and level for the rest, which roam where you are as your buddies (617e17). Asked again with no count: how it stands. "dismiss": every stand-in sent out, kept for the next asker.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_army.cpp)'),
    ('buddy bed add', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy bed add <bed|cot|floor> [note]\n\nMarks the spot you stand on, facing the way you face, as a place buddies sleep, at that comfort (bed 3, cot 2, floor 1). The note is kept with it.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_beds.cpp)'),
    ('buddy bed link', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy bed link\n\nJoins the nearest sleeping spot to the next nearest, as one shared bed; both must be within 5 yards. A third spot is joined by standing between it and one of the pair.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_beds.cpp)'),
    ('buddy bed list', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy bed list\n\nLists the sleeping spots of the area you stand in, nearest first.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_beds.cpp)'),
    ('buddy bed remove', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy bed remove\n\nRemoves the nearest sleeping spot within 10 yards.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_beds.cpp)'),
    ('buddy bed unlink', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy bed unlink\n\nThe nearest sleeping spot within 5 yards stands alone again.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_beds.cpp)'),
    ('buddy closer', 0, 'Syntax: .buddy closer\n\nBrings the ring your buddies stand in round you back in to its smallest, 5 yards, at once (617s4).\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_follow.cpp)'),
    ('buddy explore', 0, 'Syntax: .buddy explore <pinwheel|paint|rooms|disc|mixed>\n\nChooses how your own buddies explore a town (the work is in buddies_explore.cpp): the pinwheel, least paint, the room orbit, the squished circle, or each buddy a different one in turn (mixed). Any player may set it for their own buddies.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_beds.cpp)'),
    ('buddy fight', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy fight\n\nYour party''s latest fight verdict, worked out every half second while it fights (625n): boss or trash, the time left, how much health the party is short of seeing the end, what comes at each member and how long it lasts, whom each enemy attacks, and which tank should hold the hardest hitter. Only while Buddies.ForwardPass is 1.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_forward_pass.cpp)'),
    ('buddy gems', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy gems [buddy name]\n\nGems every socket of what a buddy in the world wears again: each socket a random colour that fits it, then the best gem of that colour for the buddy''s talents. No name: the selected buddy. What was socketed is replaced; free.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_gems.cpp)'),
    ('buddy kit', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy kit [buddy name]\n\nRe-dresses a buddy in the world for its level: the kit''s gear by its talent shape (gray where no white fills a slot), its class tools (totems, poisons, ammunition), and from level 18 the PvP necklace, rings and trinkets (the second ring and trinket another item than the first, from another battleground where there is one), then gems its sockets as .buddy gems does. No name: the selected buddy. What it wore is replaced.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_kit.cpp)'),
    ('buddy look', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy look <skin|face|hair|haircolor|beard> <number>\n\nChanges one part of Sargobras''s look until the server restarts. The client asks for a creature''s look when it first sees it: walk out of sight and back, or log out and in, to see the change.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_outfits.cpp)'),
    ('buddy path', 0, 'Syntax: .buddy path [orbit|flow|astar|potential|learn|paint|mesh]\n\nChooses how your own buddies find their way to each roaming waypoint (617o7, 617o8): orbit (straight at it; stuck, back out and walk round), flow (downhill on the walking distance), astar (a whole route, pulled tight), potential (pulled by the point, pushed by walls), learn (a route over what they have bumped into), paint (the painted map: one map a region, shared, learned from every step and every refusal, keeping space from walls, in lanes), or mesh (the server''s own path search, the default). Alone: the way chosen, and a table of how each way has done since the server started. Any player may set it for their own buddies.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_path.cpp)'),
    ('buddy record delete', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy record delete <number>\n\nDeletes one recording by the number the list shows.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_recorder.cpp)'),
    ('buddy record discard', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy record discard\n\nThrows away the recording in progress.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_recorder.cpp)'),
    ('buddy record list', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy record list\n\nLists the recordings of every ship stop near you, with their numbers.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_recorder.cpp)'),
    ('buddy record start', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy record start\n\nStarts recording your movements at a boat or zeppelin stop, for buddies to replay when they board or leave a ship.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_recorder.cpp)'),
    ('buddy record stop', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy record stop [note]\n\nEnds the recording, checks it is one boarding or one leaving at one stop of one ship''s route, and keeps it with the note.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_recorder.cpp)'),
    ('buddy reset', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy reset <buddy name>\n\nResets a buddy so its owner can choose its class again at Sargobras (617a7): the buddy, which must be in the world, mails everything it wears and carries and its money to itself ("Kept for you") and leaves; its slot is owed again with its race kept. Sargobras then offers only the classes that race can play, and the new buddy comes with the same name and looks and is handed the old one''s mail. From a shell: scripts/gm-command ".buddy reset <name>".\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_reset.cpp)'),
    ('buddy scene', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy scene [duel|party60|party30|party15|stop] [redraw]\n\nFight scenes (176a3): stand-ins against one monster where you stand, round after round; every half second of a fight each combatant''s state (health, power, place, targets, cast, auras, threat, running damage and healing, the spells it cast, the forward pass''s view of it) is written to LogsDir/buddies-scenes/<scene>-frames.tsv, a line per combatant, and each round''s end to <scene>.tsv; nothing is told in game. duel: two level-40 damage stand-ins against a level-45 monster, one the bot module''s way, one with the forward pass; party60, party30, party15: tank, healer and damage at 60, 30 or 15 against an elite five levels above, counted as a boss. The fallen wait for the round''s end. "redraw": new stand-ins each round. Alone: how it stands; stop: ends it.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_scenes.cpp)'),
    ('buddy spec', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy spec [buddy name]\n\nBrings a buddy in the world up to the gear spec (docs/buddy-gear-spec.md) without taking off what it earned: every lesson up to its level, weapon skills and defence at their maximum, the kit''s gear only in empty slots, its class tools, PvP jewellery when a jewellery slot is empty, its sockets gemmed. No name: the selected buddy.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_kit.cpp)'),
    ('buddy standin at', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy standin at <alliance|horde> <tank|healer|damage> <level> <map> <x> <y> <z> [race] [class]\n\nBrings a stand-in in at a place, as standin make does beside you. Scenes ask for theirs this way.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_stand_ins.cpp)'),
    ('buddy standin dismiss', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy standin dismiss <name|all>\n\nTakes a stand-in (or every one) out of the world. It is kept for the next asker.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_stand_ins.cpp)'),
    ('buddy standin list', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy standin list\n\nLists every kept stand-in: race, class, role, talent tree, level, times used, and whether it is in the world.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_stand_ins.cpp)'),
    ('buddy standin make', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy standin make <alliance|horde> <tank|healer|damage> <level> [race] [class]\n\nBrings a stand-in in beside you: a character that belongs to nobody, of that side and role at that level, race and class drawn at random unless named. A kept one that fits is used first (raised to the level if below it); otherwise a new one is made, all its talents in one tree that takes its role.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_stand_ins.cpp)'),
    ('buddy town here', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy town here <radius>\n\nPlaces a town circle of that radius, in yards, where you stand: inside it buddies behave as in town. It is written to the world database at once.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_town_circles.cpp)'),
    ('buddy town remove', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy town remove\n\nRemoves the nearest town circle that was placed by hand.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_town_circles.cpp)'),
    ('buddy town show', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy town show\n\nDraws the nearest town circle in wisps standing on its edge, for 15 seconds.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_town_circles.cpp)'),
    ('buddy trace', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy trace <buddy name|off>\n\nStarts writing a log of what that buddy decides and does (it must be online). "off" stops every trace. The reply says where the lines go.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_trace.cpp)'),
    ('buddy weather', 2, 'Syntax: .buddy weather\n\nAlterac Valley''s shared sky (921a): the kind of weather now, its strength, how far into its six-minute turn, and the rest of the shuffled deck. Shared by every match only while Buddies.AlteracWeather is 1.\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_weather.cpp)'),
    ('buddy wider', 0, 'Syntax: .buddy wider\n\nWidens the ring your buddies stand in round you when told "circle me" (the close follow, 617s2, 617s4): a step out of 5 yards, up to 25. Kept while the server runs.\nIn game only. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_follow.cpp)'),
    ('levelto', 2, 'Syntax: .levelto <name> <level>\n\nBrings a character in the world, and their buddies, to a level as if they had played there (185): every weapon skill, defence and profession keeps its share of its maximum (80% of the way stays 80%), up or down; what they wear is replaced by fresh white gear for the level, gemmed by their talents (white and grey items dropped, the rest mailed to them, "Kept for you"); each buddy in the world moves by the same number of kills ahead of (or behind) its owner. Not the server''s own .levelup, which only adds levels. From a shell: scripts/gm-command ".levelto <name> <level>".\nIn game or on the server console. (Everland Ghostsong: patches/B036-mod-buddies/mod-buddies/src/buddies_levelup.cpp)');
